==Battleground==
===<u>Chapters 1 & 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Those Guys|Snache|B.B.Bunny|Pigge|Jackie Peng|Gory}}
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 44 seconds<sup>1,320f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory]] spawns.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Those Guys|Snache|B.B.Bunny|Pigge|Jackie Peng|Gory}}
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 3~5 seconds<sup>90f~150f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Gory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Spamming [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] is enough to beat this stage and collect all the Score Rewards.

